A||||5||BC-GT||'55 Chevy Belair roadtrip||||6||
Z||000000||BC-GT||04-24-2001||09:49 PM||||Ok kids, here's the deal. my bud from Winnipeg is driving out here at the end of May to pick me up for a road trip through the States. We hwve most of the trip planned already but could use some interesting stops/sights along the West coast from Vancouver,BC to Los Angeles. Will be taking the Sony digital camera to capture all the Fieros and other sights. Very nice car, 454 4 speed.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p865e6a34b8255d5e9ff5662c04224735/fe9a4373.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p259feea12f5cfefd963c53205f6531a2/fe9a42d0.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p59319b82f3a1789fb5e34f53e82484ee/fe9a40e4.jpg.orig.jpg"> <BR>More pics here <A HREF="http://www.imagestation.com/album/?id=4292729791" TARGET=_blank>http://www.imagestation.com/album/?id=4292729791</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000001||gixxer||04-24-2001||10:13 PM||||Nothing to see in Washington but Mt.St.Helens.<BR>Crater Lake is cool in Oregon.<BR>Get on Hwy 1 in California as soon as you can and enjoy the ocean view. Hope that shoebox handles the corners!<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||loafer87gt||04-24-2001||11:09 PM||||Man, that should be a blast. Theres something satisfying about going on a week long bender down in the states! Last year me and my older bro found a place down in Whitefish,Montana, i think the name was the Big Bear cafe, but anyways they took Canadian money at face value! I had the biggest burger i have ever seen with a huge side of fries for like $5. Man did we ever get right ripped on the cheap beer as well. One thing I got a kick out was the can in the joint. It was a big room with a couple of urinals and a toilet in the middle of the room (no walls around it) wallpaper with hardcore porn! Crazy Americans! Have a blast man   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by loafer87gt (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Wolfhound||04-25-2001||06:10 AM||||Beautiful 55, He has really built a classic hot rod. Wow!||||reg||14
